  "notes": "The live set with its cluster and data alphas re-tuned on year 1 (2023-10-02 to 2024-09-30) by 0002's procedure on injected events (Choices 5: per detector the alpha with the fewest other episodes among those detecting at least 80 % of 40 injected events from 2024-04-01 to 2024-08-15, else the one detecting most; the table is in the extra field `retune_table`). The detectors saw no data after 2024-09-30 while tuning. PARTLY tuned on test: the rising-trend test (alpha 0.001, 28-day bins, D-022 exclusion; its 24-month window cannot be tuned on year 1) and new-in-unit (180 days, chosen on E2) keep their shipped settings, which were chosen on E4 and E2 inside the scoring period (field `partly_tuned_on_test`). `tuned_on_test` is false for the cluster and data parts and the row is the reference that new methods are compared against. Read as the shipped row's notes, with level = 1 meaning the re-tuned alphas.",
